9
00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:08.080
I didn't stare.

10
00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:09.630
You looked.

11
00:02:10.160 --> 00:02:13.760
You'd like it if you're such a schmuck
how are you, looked at you?

12
