13
00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:19.770
- Sorry.
- Come to your senses.

14
00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:23.640
- Sorry.
- Why were you looking, huh?

15
00:02:25.110 --> 00:02:27.480
Lost your fear?

16
00:02:29.150 --> 00:02:32.090
- Sorry.
- Stop apologizing.

17
00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:35.890
- Sorry.
- Yes, you got it!

18
00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:37.950
Do you want to die?

19
