161
00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:22.670
Now we need to focus on Uigyeom.

162
00:13:25.170 --> 00:13:28.640
Have you noticed that lately Euigyeom...
changed?

163
00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:35.420
Every day he has
new abrasions on the face.

164
00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:46.160
What do you mean?

165
00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:50.100
You don't see it, do you?

166
00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:53.000
You're only interested in his grades.

167
00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:58.360
How Sugyeom experienced
stress and beat up Eugyeom,

168
00:13:59.570 --> 00:14:02.340
So Eigyom began to get into fights.

169
00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:17.960
I'm home.

170
00:14:24.470 --> 00:14:25.430
Kim Eugyom.

171
00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:29.100
Eigyom, go to the room.

172
00:14:29.570 --> 00:14:30.500
Kim Eugyom.

173
00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:33.470
Yes.

174
00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:43.380
Give me your cassette player.

175
00:14:46.890 --> 00:14:47.860
For what?

176
00:14:49.620 --> 00:14:51.230
He said give it back, so give it away.

177
00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:53.930
Why are you walking around with this old thing?

178
00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:57.030
Will you contradict your father?

179
00:14:58.470 --> 00:15:00.600
Get to the room, quickly!

180
00:15:03.370 --> 00:15:04.370
Eugyom!

181
00:15:06.640 --> 00:15:07.980
I said, give me the cassette player!

182
00:15:18.320 --> 00:15:19.320
Dad...

183
00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:23.360
